  "description": "Park Ki-Doo went from being an executive to a delivery driver after his father’s company went bankrupt. \n\nHaving given up on life, Ki-doo meets various people while working as a delivery driver, discovers aspects of himself, life, and joy he never knew existed, and sets out on a new journey... \n\n\"Hey, delivery man... Could you come in for a moment and help me with this?\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Toptoon](https://toptoon.com/comic/ep_list/Parcel_Service), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H043995966), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H043995966)",
